  "id": "section-847",
  "title": "要支持群众的革命串连",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-227.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>227)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　这是很重要的事，应该大搞，没有了不起的问题，要支持群众的革命串连，要搞就大搞，不会没地方住的。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（摘自××一九六六年十一月十八日给我被苏修无理勒令回国的留学生的报告）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-226.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-228.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
